# AI-assisted art is generated into an isolated, review-only workspace.
# Only manifests, prompts, benchmarks, and approved production assets belong
# in Git; raw/candidate/cleaned files may contain provider metadata.
art/pixellab/staging/**
!art/pixellab/staging/.gitkeep

